# Run: dotnet run --project samples/Shop.Controllers
@host = http://localhost:5181
@orderId = paste-an-order-id-here

### Customer error codes
GET {{host}}/api/error-codes

### Admin error codes (keyed "admin" catalog)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/error-codes

### 401 as a failed Result, in the envelope
POST {{host}}/api/orders

### Create an order: { "data": { ... }, "is_success": true, "status": 200, ... }
POST {{host}}/api/orders
X-User: alice

### 400 validation errors (this app keeps the default 400 for Invalid)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/lines
X-User: alice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "", "quantity": 9 }

### 400 orders_1004: nothing to pay for yet
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
X-User: alice
